GET http://localhost:8080/api/users/me

### Logout TEST
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users/logout



### ===========================
### prompt 파트
### ===========================

### 1. 전체 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/api/prompts/list

### 2. 상세 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/api/prompts/detail?id=1

### 3. 등록
POST http://localhost:8080/api/prompts/create
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

userId=1&
categoryId=1&
title=테스트 제목&
description=테스트 설명&
content=테스트 내용

### 4. 수정
POST http://localhost:8080/api/prompts/update
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

promptId=15&
categoryId=2&
title=수정된 제목&
description=수정된 설명&
content=수정된 내용


### 5. 삭제
POST http://localhost:8080/api/prompts/delete
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

promptId=15
=======
  "password": "hashed_pw_1"
}

